# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
ANOVA version of the revised manuscript: text that replaces the separation-version text of revised_text_116.py.
Incorporates the corrections of Tal Shay (Human_Mouse_Splicing_revised_tracked_TS2.docx, accepted) and answers her
comments. Human-mouse classification: one junction per event; ANOVA over the five datasets (unchanged), then the
Wilcoxon test of all human vs all mouse samples, mean human-mouse |dPSI| >= 0.1 and > 2 x mean within-species |dPSI|
(differentially spliced). Numbers from ensembl116/revision_6ds/manuscript_numbers.md (facts_116.py) and
events/id50_6ds_anova/classification/.
Applied at the end of revised_text_116.py: EDITS.update(UPDATES); INSERTS.update(INSERT_UPDATES).
"""

